sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant App as Android App
  participant API as Verification API
  participant OCR as OCR/ANPR
  participant CP as Compliance Provider
  participant Rules as Rules Engine
  participant DB as PostgreSQL/Audit

  User->>App: Capture vehicle image
  App->>API: Create verification + idempotency key
  API->>OCR: Extract plate
  OCR-->>API: Candidate + confidence
  alt Low confidence / ambiguous
    API-->>App: Request confirmation
    User->>App: Confirm/correct plate
    App->>API: Confirm registration
  end
  API->>CP: Authorized compliance lookup
  CP-->>API: Compliance record / not found / error
  API->>Rules: Evaluate status
  Rules-->>API: Decision + rule version
  API->>DB: Persist verification + audit event
  API-->>App: Result + evidence + action
